<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>It's Your Life</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Lenny Kravitz</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">5</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">20wR6PTN2m0CqJMrfoSOZN</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.680" end="00:24.570">They say that our love is all wrong</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.570" end="00:29.190">And that we should not carry on</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.190" end="00:37.190">But I say theye  wrong  I want you so bad</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.820" end="00:43.350">Wee been together for so long</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.350" end="00:48.120">How could they think we don belong?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.120" end="00:56.120">But theyl never know  what you and I have</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.420" end="00:59.790">Call your mama</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.790" end="01:02.220">Call your papa</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.220" end="01:04.410">Call the preacher</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.410" end="01:06.930">Hold on  hold on</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.930" end="01:09.300">Call your mama</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.300" end="01:11.250">Call your papa</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.250" end="01:13.980">Go on and call the preacher</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.980" end="01:16.140">Hold on  hold on</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.140" end="01:21.360">All  I want to do is take it all the way with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.360" end="01:29.360">It your life, it your life</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.640" end="01:40.410">They say that we don have a chance</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.410" end="01:45.150">Wee victims of unjust romance</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.150" end="01:53.150">But they couldn see  the truth in their hands</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.360" end="01:59.430">We don have to live like they do</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.430" end="02:04.230">Wel run away if we have to</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.230" end="02:12.230">And wel start a life  that  shining and new</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.380" end="02:15.750">Call your mama</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.750" end="02:18.210">Call your papa</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.210" end="02:20.490">Call the preacher</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.490" end="02:22.860">Hold on  hold on</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.860" end="02:25.260">Call your mama</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.260" end="02:33.260">Call your papa</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:41.550" end="02:49.550">Go on and  call the  preacher</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:56.970" end="04:00.970">Hold  on hold  on</p></div></body></tt>